// ── ELEMENT SPEC ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// input/output image plane → BoxGeometry(1.76, 1.76, 0.08), noise CanvasTexture
// feature-map volume       → BoxGeometry(s, s, depth) terracotta material array
//                            (front +z #b96a43, sides #8a4a2e, top #d98d63)
// paired 256×256×128 slabs → two tall slabs on each side (encoder & decoder)
// skip connection          → THREE.Line polyline salmon #d98d63 in z=0.5 plane,
//                            ending at the decoder block's LEFT SIDE face with a
//                            cone arrowhead aligned to the final segment
// flow arrow               → ArrowHelper, dark #3a3a3a (res) / light #9ab0bc (+attn)
// time-embedding trunk     → THREE.Line #5f7a8a at y=-1.5 (constant arrows)
